CLASS net/minecraft/world/entity/Entity
	FIELD uuid Ljava/util/UUID;
		COMMENT A [java.util.UUID] used to distinguish between different instances of Entity.
	METHOD addDeltaMovement (Lnet/minecraft/world/phys/Vec3;)V
		COMMENT Add the provided velocity vector to this entity's velocity.
		COMMENT @see #markHurt()
	METHOD defineSynchedData (Lnet/minecraft/network/syncher/SynchedEntityData$Builder;)V
		COMMENT Defines the data that will be synched from the server to the client.
		COMMENT @see net.minecraft.network.syncher.SynchedEntityData
	METHOD discard ()V
		COMMENT Removes this Entity from the [net.minecraft.world.level.Level] it is in.
		COMMENT
		COMMENT The Entity ceases all interactions with the rest of the Level and is not saved to Level data.
	METHOD entityTags ()Ljava/util/Set;
		COMMENT Returns this Entity's tags.
		COMMENT @see net.minecraft.server.commands.TagCommand
	METHOD fireImmune ()Z
		COMMENT Returns whether this entity is immune to fire and lava damage.
	METHOD getTeamColor ()I
		COMMENT Returns the color associated with the [net.minecraft.world.scores.Team] this Entity is part of in the `0xRRGGBB` format.
		COMMENT @return the team color in the `0xRRGGBB` format, or [net.minecraft.util.CommonColors#WHITE] if the Entity is not part of a Team or the Team has no color
	METHOD getViewVector (F)Lnet/minecraft/world/phys/Vec3;
		COMMENT Return a vector representing the direction this entity is looking.
		COMMENT @param a The partial ticks to use for interpolation, or `1` to not interpolate.
	METHOD getXRot ()F
		COMMENT Returns the rotation of the entity around the x-axis (its pitch) in degrees.
	METHOD getYRot ()F
		COMMENT Returns the rotation of the entity around the y-axis (its yaw) in degrees.
	METHOD isSpectator ()Z
		COMMENT Returns if this entity is in spectator mode.
		COMMENT
		COMMENT In a vanilla context, this is always false for all non-[net.minecraft.world.entity.player.Player]s.
	METHOD kill (Lnet/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel;)V
		COMMENT Kills this Entity.
		COMMENT
		COMMENT This removes the Entity from the [net.minecraft.world.level.Level] it is in.
		COMMENT The Entity ceases all interactions with the rest of the Level and is not saved to Level data.
		COMMENT
		COMMENT Additionally, [net.minecraft.world.level.gameevent.GameEvent#ENTITY_DIE] is broadcast.
	METHOD markHurt ()V
		COMMENT Mark that this entity's velocity should be synched to the client.
	METHOD setDeltaMovement (DDD)V
		COMMENT Set the velocity of this entity on each axis.
		COMMENT @see #markHurt()
	METHOD setDeltaMovement (Lnet/minecraft/world/phys/Vec3;)V
		COMMENT Set the velocity of this entity to the provided velocity vector.
		COMMENT @see #markHurt()
	METHOD setSharedFlag (IZ)V
		COMMENT Sets a shared flag that's synched from the server to the client.
		COMMENT @param flag The flag to set. The static variables in this class prefixed with `FLAG_`, such as [#FLAG_ONFIRE] show the meaning of different flag values.
	CLASS RemovalReason
		COMMENT Reasons an [net.minecraft.world.entity.Entity] is removed from a [net.minecraft.world.level.Level].
